{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROTTING WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of MOULD unfolds in an alternative industrial version of the Soviet Union at the end of the 1940s. There was no World War II; construction sites are bustling across the USSR, and scientists are diligently working on creating steel builders for a bright future. At one of the mining enterprises, miners come across something unimaginable, and humanity faces a deadly threat. From the depths emerges a parasite \u2014 a creature capable of controlling living organisms, gradually devouring them from within. As it reproduces, it begins to alter the environment, making it more comfortable for itself but unbearable for the planet\u2019s ordinary inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/e44c08093271df5c7c180e48ada00ba8.poster.avif?t=1774014089\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/e44c08093271df5c7c180e48ada00ba8.webm?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/e44c08093271df5c7c180e48ada00ba8.mp4?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT TO THE LAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to fight in enclosed arenas, against an overwhelming enemy force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The parasite is always watching the hero's every move. If not all enemies on the arena are destroyed before an alarm signal reaches the parasite, the next battle will become much more difficult, as the enemies' characteristics will increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To effectively destroy the infestation, the hero will be aided by a large arsenal of melee and heavy ranged weapons, in the form of a family of experimental shotguns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/d7c7b92647f109fbcdbf14ba5f7d530a.poster.avif?t=1774014089\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/d7c7b92647f109fbcdbf14ba5f7d530a.webm?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/d7c7b92647f109fbcdbf14ba5f7d530a.mp4?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIVE INTO SMOLDERING RUINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge region, divided into areas, awaits you. In each of them, you will have to explore the territory while simultaneously destroying the infestation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unravel the mysteries of what is happening, look for workers' notes and carefully examine your surroundings. Who knows what the parasite has carefully hidden from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/8637d39b857fa1925ee2ec1a11175a46.poster.avif?t=1774014089\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/8637d39b857fa1925ee2ec1a11175a46.webm?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/8637d39b857fa1925ee2ec1a11175a46.mp4?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment captures the atmosphere of a dying, once-prosperous world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast locations open for exploration via multiple paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of weapons: from a knife to a chemical sprayer that dissolves anyone who dares to stand in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty, affecting enemy characteristics.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821970?t=1774014089","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/9ba363c2cf6e4d74ac18c99a4d66e7bb848fbf2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774014089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/4c3bc50f15cf986af1fb468abfeab7d711c478dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774014089","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/4c3bc50f15cf986af1fb468abfeab7d711c478dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774014089","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of violence, blood, and gore, as well as imagery that may be disturbing to some players."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROTTING WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of MOULD unfolds in an alternative industrial version of the Soviet Union at the end of the 1940s. There was no World War II; construction sites are bustling across the USSR, and scientists are diligently working on creating steel builders for a bright future. At one of the mining enterprises, miners come across something unimaginable, and humanity faces a deadly threat. From the depths emerges a parasite \u2014 a creature capable of controlling living organisms, gradually devouring them from within. As it reproduces, it begins to alter the environment, making it more comfortable for itself but unbearable for the planet\u2019s ordinary inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/e44c08093271df5c7c180e48ada00ba8.poster.avif?t=1774014089\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/e44c08093271df5c7c180e48ada00ba8.webm?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/e44c08093271df5c7c180e48ada00ba8.mp4?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT TO THE LAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to fight in enclosed arenas, against an overwhelming enemy force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The parasite is always watching the hero's every move. If not all enemies on the arena are destroyed before an alarm signal reaches the parasite, the next battle will become much more difficult, as the enemies' characteristics will increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To effectively destroy the infestation, the hero will be aided by a large arsenal of melee and heavy ranged weapons, in the form of a family of experimental shotguns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/d7c7b92647f109fbcdbf14ba5f7d530a.poster.avif?t=1774014089\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/d7c7b92647f109fbcdbf14ba5f7d530a.webm?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/d7c7b92647f109fbcdbf14ba5f7d530a.mp4?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIVE INTO SMOLDERING RUINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge region, divided into areas, awaits you. In each of them, you will have to explore the territory while simultaneously destroying the infestation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unravel the mysteries of what is happening, look for workers' notes and carefully examine your surroundings. Who knows what the parasite has carefully hidden from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/8637d39b857fa1925ee2ec1a11175a46.poster.avif?t=1774014089\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/8637d39b857fa1925ee2ec1a11175a46.webm?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/8637d39b857fa1925ee2ec1a11175a46.mp4?t=1774014089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment captures the atmosphere of a dying, once-prosperous world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast locations open for exploration via multiple paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of weapons: from a knife to a chemical sprayer that dissolves anyone who dares to stand in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty, affecting enemy characteristics.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Krol4tka"],"genres":[{"description":"Acti