193bb.600x338.jpg?t=1774014089"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/2103c8fb0a4cc01e7c6cf8b84505bf627eb331a1/ss_2103c8fb0a4cc01e7c6cf8b84505bf627eb331a1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774014089","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/2103c8fb0a4cc01e7c6cf8b84505bf627eb331a1/ss_2103c8fb0a4cc01e7c6cf8b84505bf627eb331a1.600x338.jpg?t=1774014089"}],"short_description":"MOULD is an adventure horror game about a shattered Soviet dream. The Earth is slowly becoming uninhabitable, humanity is gone, and its place has been taken by a monstrous life form, capable of surviving in the planet's new conditions.","steam_appid":3821970,"support_info":{"email":"lsdifeatflow@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Russian, Armenian","type":"game","website":null}